            {
              "text": "Hajj has three shapes; you pick one first",
              "size": "hook",
              "at": 0.0,
              "until": 3.99
            },
            {
              "text": "At the miqat, for a Hajj in Dhul Hijjah",
              "size": "h1",
              "at": 4.33,
              "until": 8.24
            },
            {
              "text": "Tamattu: Umrah first, then out, then Hajj",
              "size": "h1",
              "at": 8.58,
              "until": 12.52
            },
            {
              "text": "Qiran: one ihram holds both, start to end",
              "sub": "a sacrifice is due, as it is for tamattu",
              "size": "h1",
              "at": 12.86,
              "until": 20.04
            },
            {
              "text": "Ifrad: Hajj alone, and no sacrifice falls",
              "size": "h1",
              "at": 20.38,
              "until": 24.32
            },
            {
              "text": "For qiran, most say one tawaf serves both",
              "sub": "Hanafis require two tawafs, two sa'is",
              "size": "h1",
              "at": 24.66,
              "until": 31.49
            },
            {
              "text": "Maliki and Shafi'i say ifrad is best",
              "sub": "Hanafi picks qiran; Hanbali picks tamattu",
              "size": "h1",
              "at": 31.83,
              "until": 38.54
            },
            {
              "text": "Whichever you pick, choose it before ihram",
              "size": "h1",
              "at": 38.88,
              "until": 42.89
            },
